1
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:37,000
I think I should take a look at it

2
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,800
Where is it?

3
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:47,400
You mentioned there were writings in
the Manual of Deity of Medicine

4
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,400
Can I take a look at them?

5
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:54,400
What's there to see?
I've told you the content

6
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,200
I'm afraid you'd missed out something

7
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:01,400
Here's what was written in it:

8
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:05,800
"The Deity of Medicine of Heavenly
Abode revealed to resurrect life"

9
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:09,200
-That's all?
-Yes, nothing more

10
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:16,600
The Deity of Medicine never helps
others without an exchange of favours

11
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,600
How odd

12
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:21,600
Ruyi, what are you muttering about?
What's worrying you?

13
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,400
We can't possibly have it so good

14
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,800
Why is he willing to treat me
with no exchange of favours

15
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:34,400
He's a sage while we're mere mortals.
We can't read his mind, can we?

16
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:38,200
Stop pondering over it.
Get some rest

17
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:43,000
Ruyi, I only want
your face treated soon

18
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:46,800
Get some rest if you feel tired.
I'll pull the cart

19
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:01,400
Shuangxi, stop sweeping the floor

20
00:03:01,600 --> 00:03:05,200
No matter how clean the place is,
no one will come here to offer prayers

21
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:09,000
Those three old fogeys of
Three Star Temple are useless!

22
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:12,800
They were so heartless to leave
this tortoise behind

23
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:17,800
The Trio were my father's saviours.
Don't make such disrespectful remarks

24
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:22,800
Tortoise, tell her to stop
deceiving herself and others

25
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:26,200
No one knows where
the three old men have gone to

26
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:30,000
Would the people forget them
if they answered their prayers?

27
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:34,800
Even if the whole world
abandons them, I'll still be here

28
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,400
I believe the Trio will
reveal themselves again

29
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:39,800
Stubborn girl!

30
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,600
Do you agree?

31
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:43,800
What can I do
if you persist in your belief?

32
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,800
I'll leave this tortoise with you.
I'll get back to work

33
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,400
Bye

34
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:52,400
Don't you have something to tell me?

35
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,200
Take care. Goodbye

36
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:58,200
Not that. That wasn't
what you said the other day

37
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,200
Eat more.
Don't starve yourself

38
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,800
Not that! What's so important
about a meal?

39
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:08,200
What do you say to someone
who's going to discuss a business?

40
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,800
I wish Fuqi good fortune

41
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:18,400
-May your every wish come true
-Thank you!

42
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:21,200
I'm off

43
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:26,800
Be cordial when you negotiate a deal.
Don't start trouble

44
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,400
Of course!
Bye!

45
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:32,000
Have you memorized the rules
Sister Ma laid down?

46
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:36,000
I'll recite them now.
Prick your ears

47
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,400
No gambling, no fighting,

48
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:40,400
no sweet-talking, no lying,

49
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:43,600
no stealing, no cheating,
no robbing, no idling...

50
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:46,800
-Louder!
-No gambling, no fighting...

51
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:52,400
Little tortoise, when will
the three stars return?

52
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:11,400
You've been on a winning streak

53
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:14,200
Whatever you've put your money on
turn out to be winners

54
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:17,400
-Has some master enlightened you?
-That person is Shuangxi

55
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:21,800
When did Miss Shuangxi
become a fortune-teller?

56
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:25,800
I've discovered that each time
Shuangxi wishes me luck,

57
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:30,000
I'll make a killing
at the gaming table!

58
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,800
That's amazing!

59
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:36,400
I'm enjoying good fortune and
every wish of mine come true

60
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:40,200
Let's get Miss Shuangxi to say
a few good wishes to us

61
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:46,200
Fools, all of you!

62
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:49,400
I lied to Shuangxi that
I would be out negotiating deals

63
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:52,400
If you go to her,
she'll know I've been lying

64
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:56,800
What's more, her good wishes
only work on me!

65
00:05:56,800 --> 00:06:00,400
-Don't you ruin it for me, get it?
-Yes, yes

66
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:02,200
Let's carry on with our game

67
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:13,000
-Shuangxi!
-Coming

68
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,400
Shuangxi...

69
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:19,800
-It's you
-I'm here to see Shuangxi

70
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:23,400
Brother Fuqi, aren't you discussing
a business deal? That's fast

71
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:26,800
Given my eloquence,
I closed the deal in no time at all

72
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:31,200
Look what I've got for you!
Fish and meat! We're in for a feast

73
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:34,200
Where did you pick them from?

74
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:37,800
Come on, I paid for them.
They're very fresh

75
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,800
Here you go

76
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:43,800
I bought these two bales of cloth
for you to make new dresses

77
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,400
Do you like them?

78
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:48,800
The shopkeeper told me they were
brought in from the Capital

79
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,800
They were exclusive to his shop.
Look at the fine quality

80
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:55,400
Where did you get all the money from?
Did you have a windfall?

81
00:06:55,400 --> 00:06:58,800
Not yet, but it'll happen
in the near future

82
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:02,800
Brother Fuqi, you should save
some money. Don't be so wasteful

83
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:06,600
Shuangxi, I don't consider
spending on you a waste of money

84
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,600
What's more, I've been on a roll...

85
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:11,800
Got you!
Have you been gambling?

86
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:14,800
No. I said it out of habit

87
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:17,600
I was saying I had money to spare

88
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:21,680
Besides, I promised Shuangxi
I'd quit gambling. Right?

89
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:25,000
Yes. Brother Fuqi will
keep his promise

90
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,200
He recites the rules every day too.
So no gambling for him

91
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:29,200
Shuangxi knows me better

92
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:32,200
I'm glad to know you don't gamble

93
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:36,200
Our mother was a gambler and
got herself into a huge debt

94
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:38,600
In the end, she hanged herself

95
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:41,400
Sis, let's not bring up the past

96
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:45,200
Gambling is a great evil indeed

97
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:49,800
Shuangxi, I finally understand why
you hate gambling so much

98
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:54,200
You said it! Now, if I catch you
gambling again,

99
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:56,400
you shan't step into our house again

100
00:07:56,400 --> 00:08:00,800
Don't you worry. I've promised
Shuangxi I won't gamble again

101
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:03,200
If I do that, I'm a stupid idiot

102
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:08,400
If there's nothing else,
you may go back

103
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:15,200
Oh, yes! My mother is down
with a cold. I have to...

104
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:18,800
Your mother is unwell?
I'll go and see her

105
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:22,400
Whatever for?
You can't wait to go away, can you?

106
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:26,800
Don't say that, Sis. If you fall ill
in future, I'll brew medicine for you

107
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:28,800
Touch wood!

108
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,200
Wu Fuqi! Shuangxi!
Come back!

109
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:41,800
-Give it to me!
-Over my dead body!

110
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,800
Peng Datou, how dare you snatch
my mother's money!

111
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:49,800
Give it to him!
Beat him to death

112
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:50,800
Stop it!

113
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:54,200
-See if I don't kill you!
-You've wronged me! That's my money

114
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,800
Says who!

115
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:59,800
I won the money in gambling

116
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,400
You gave it to me, so it's mine now!

117
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:04,400
I lost money today. Can't I use it
to recoup my losses?

118
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:07,800
No! If you lose the money,
I'll be left with nothing

119
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,800
I've seen through you!

120
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:13,800
No wonder it's said a couple go their
separate ways in times of trouble

121
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:15,200
You... you...

122
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:18,800
That's true about married couples

123
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,600
But what's our relationship?
We're not even married

124
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,800
Don't talk to me about being a couple

125
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:27,400
How many times have I told you
to quit gambling?

126
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:30,800
But you just won't listen.
Gamblers lose 9 out of 10 times

127
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:34,800
My name isn't Wu Fuqi if I don't
wake you up to your senses!

128
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,000
Wait!

129
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,800
Just don't hit my face

130
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:44,800
-Hit him!
-I'll kill you!

131
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:49,400
-Stay right there!
-Don't give chase!

132
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:53,400
I've told my mother umpteen times
to leave that man

133
00:09:53,400 --> 00:09:56,200
He's an incorrigible gambler

134
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:59,400
-That's enough
-Gambling is terrible!

135
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:04,800
My body itches
at the mention of gambling

136
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:10,000
Shuangxi, I just remembered
I have a business appointment

137
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,400
-I won't be long
-I'll go with you

138
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:16,800
It's all right. You'll stay
with my mother at home

139
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,400
Stay with your mother?

140
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:22,400
You owe me two lines, remember?

141
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:27,800
I wish you good fortune and
every wish of yours come true!

142
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,800
See, my body has stopped itching.
Thank you

143
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,400
Come back early!

144
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:42,400
-Any more money?
-No

145
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:46,800
-What an unlucky hand!
-If only Boss were around

146
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:49,800
-Exactly
-Let's go

147
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:53,800
Boss, you've come!

148
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:58,800
Your face tells me you've lost again

149
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:02,800
We've been losing every game
since you left. What rotten luck!

150
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:09,000
Not to worry. Just tag along my bets
and you'll recoup your losses!

151
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,400
-All right?
-Yes! Let's do it

152
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:19,800
-Wu Fuqi, it's you again!
-That's right

153
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:22,400
You're not welcome here

154
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:27,800
-And why am I not welcome?
-Look behind you

155
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:29,920
-Look behind you?
-Go away

156
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:33,400
What does it say?

157
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:37,000
"Beware of this man.
Reject his bets. Wu Fuqi"

158
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,800
I've been blacklisted, huh?

159
00:11:41,800 --> 00:11:44,200
Are you afraid of me?
Are you?

160
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:47,000
Let's wreck their place and
show them who's boss!

161
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:50,400
Need we do that?
Am I such a petty fellow?

162
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:55,000
I've got money. I can always go
somewhere else. Let's go!

163
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,800
Just come with me

164
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:02,800
If this place rejects us,
we can always go somewhere else

165
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:08,400
We've got money. We'll always
be welcome elsewhere

166
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:16,200
Boss, you've been on a roll. Which
gambling den will still accept us?

167
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:20,800
Take a break, Boss.
Let's lie low for a while

168
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,800
I have no problem skipping meals

169
00:12:23,800 --> 00:12:30,000
But if I don't get to touch the dice
in a day, it'll kill me

170
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,800
-Wu Fuqi!
-Yes?

171
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:36,400
Shuangxi?

172
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:54,800
Shuangxi?

173
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:58,800
-What did you promise me?
-I...

174
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:00,800
What did you promise me?

175
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:04,400
I... I didn't mean to lie to you

176
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,800
What did you promise me?

177
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,200
I...

178
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:13,000
I promised I'd quit gambling
or I'd be a stupid idiot

179
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:16,400
Go and be one right now!

180
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:20,800
I don't ever want to see you again!
Never again!

181
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:24,800
-Shuangxi, hear me out!
-Let me go!

182
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:26,800
I didn't mean to lie to you...
Let me explain

183
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:45,400
Boss, are you all right?

184
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:49,800
I'm heartbroken now.
Are you my buddies?

185
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:53,000
Yes! Boss, shall we teach
Yu Shuangxi a lesson?

186
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,400
Let's give her a beating.
I'll vindicate you

187
00:13:55,400 --> 00:14:00,400
Not that. Just allow me to give
the few of you a few punches...

188
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,400
to assuage the pain in my heart

189
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:05,600
Don't do that to us...

190
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,400
Come on

191
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:11,800
I've found you a great target
to vent your frustrations on

192
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:19,400
Peng Datou! I said no gambling
but here you are again!

193
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:21,200
This is your unlucky day!

194
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:23,200
Stay right there!

195
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:26,400
Stay right there!
Give it to me!

196
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:31,400
Stop running!
See if I don't make you sorry!

197
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:38,200
Scoundrel!
I'll kill you!

198
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:41,400
Stay right there!

199
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:49,000
See if I don't kill you, scoundrel!
Stay right there!

200
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:55,200
Come out!

201
00:14:57,600 --> 00:15:00,800
Stay right there!
I dare you to stay right there!

202
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,800
I'll kill you!

203
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:14,400
How dare you retaliate!

204
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,400
Break it up!

205
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,800
-Why won't you let me off?
-You bully my mother!

206
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:25,600
-Why not? You bully her too!
-I can, but not you!

207
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:27,800
Don't you break the things here

208
00:15:27,800 --> 00:15:29,600
Rest assured I'll pay you back

209
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Scoundrel

210
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,400
You actually smash it on me...

211
00:15:55,600 --> 00:16:00,400
Master, the temple is
a place of serenity for meditation

212
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:03,400
So why are you distracted
and fidgety?

213
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:07,000
Abbot, you wouldn't understand anyway

214
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:09,800
I... I just can't sit still

215
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,400
Amitabha

216
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:15,400
Talk to me. I may just surprise you
by understanding your problem

217
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:22,000
Abbot, you want me to sit here and
you won't let me go anywhere

218
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:25,000
I feel like I'm being imprisoned

219
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:28,800
Chaos are rampant in the three realms

220
00:16:28,800 --> 00:16:31,600
Life is akin to a jail term

221
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:35,400
It all boils down to how
you free yourself from it

222
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:40,400
Here, sit down.
Carry on with your meditation

223
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:43,200
Master, Her Highness is here

224
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:48,400
Amitabha

225
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:54,400
-Greetings, Your Highness
-You may rise

226
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:56,200
Thank you, Your Highness

227
00:16:56,400 --> 00:16:59,800
Young Master Wei, you look bored

228
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:04,200
More than that. He calls
his time here a prison term

229
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:10,400
Your Highness, that little monk
and I get along well

230
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:14,800
I understand him perfectly.
He loves to spout nonsense

231
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,200
Please take a seat, Your Highness

232
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:41,800
Hongying, you may wait outside for me

233
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:44,200
Yes, Your Highness

234
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:48,800
I received a letter
from my father yesterday

235
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:53,800
Ma Ruyi and Shou managed to find
the pill cauldron in Eastern Sea

236
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:58,400
The pills made from it
eradicated the epidemic

237
00:17:58,400 --> 00:18:01,400
Peace has been restored
in Ping'an Town

238
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:03,400
That's good news

239
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:10,200
-When are you returning to Ping'an?
-Not for the time being

240
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:11,600
Why?

241
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:16,200
It's been my father's hope that I'll
excel in the imperial examination...

242
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,920
and bring glory to my family

243
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:21,400
Ah, the folly of youth.
I frittered my time away

244
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:25,400
The recent happenings
have knocked some sense into me

245
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:29,800
Since I'm already in the Capital,
I should sit for the examination

246
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:32,800
I'm behind you on this

247
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,200
Thank you, Your Highness

248
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:38,800
The Palace has
a good collection of books

249
00:18:38,800 --> 00:18:40,800
How about you come to the Palace
tomorrow to pick up...

250
00:18:40,800 --> 00:18:44,200
a few books to prepare yourself
for the examination?

251
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,600
That's great!

252
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:51,800
-Outrageous!
-Help us, Your Excellency

253
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:54,200
He's turned our brothel upside down

254
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:58,000
He's also wrecked my gambling den
beyond recognition

255
00:18:58,000 --> 00:19:00,400
Wu Fuqi has no regard for the law!

256
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:04,200
Your Excellency, what can you expect
from a lawless man?

257
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:08,800
Your Excellency must redress our
grievances and teach him a lesson

258
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:13,800
Wu Fuqi, you've stretched
my tolerance to the limits

259
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:19,000
Your Excellency, he had the gall
to wreck our shops

260
00:19:19,000 --> 00:19:22,200
By snubbing us, he'd also given
Your Excellency the snub

261
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:28,200
Yes, yes! He knew Your Excellency was
our patron and yet he did all that

262
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:30,600
That was an affront
to Your Excellency

263
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:35,000
Your Excellency must do something
before he gets more brazen

264
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:38,000
Enough said!
I know what to do

265
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,800
Get out of here!

266
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:46,800
I must teach that Wu Fuqi
a lesson or two!

267
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:59,000
Ladies, have you seen Miss Yu around?

268
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:01,400
-Yu Shuangxi
-No, we've not seen her

269
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:04,400
-Really? Thanks
-You're welcome

270
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:15,400
What did I do?
Why are you arresting me?

271
00:20:15,520 --> 00:20:19,600
Wu Fuqi, the gall of you
to wreck my territory!

272
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:21,800
How dare you ruin my source of income

273
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:26,800
Your Excellency, when did I ruin
your source of income?

274
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:28,800
Don't you malign me!

275
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:32,800
How dare you argue with me!
Men, take him back to the yamen!

276
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:39,200
You're a bully!
Help! Help!

277
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,600
The officials are bullies. Help!

278
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:50,600
-Ouch... I'm in great pain
-Ha! Serves you right!

279
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,200
Scoundrel! What did you say?!

280
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:58,600
-I'll kick you!
-Stop fighting!

281
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:02,200
Time to take your medicine. Here!

282
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:08,000
And you! What did you do? Why did
Shi Yaoqian beat you up in public?

283
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:10,200
Ouch! Beats me too

284
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:13,800
Thanks to my name,
I've been down on my luck

285
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:17,800
Did I give you that name? Weren't you
enjoying a streak of good fortune?

286
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,800
I owed my good fortune to Shuangxi

287
00:21:19,920 --> 00:21:23,800
Now that she's ignoring me,
the good fortune has left me

288
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,400
Stop drinking it!

289
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:30,400
Don't blame it on luck. You've made
yourself too many enemies

290
00:21:30,400 --> 00:21:33,200
-Shut up!
-I've yet to settle my score with you

291
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,800
Break it up!

292
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:40,800
You must have done something to upset
a nice girl like Shuangxi

293
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:45,400
She's ignoring me because I gambled

294
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:47,200
Stop drinking it!

295
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:51,600
And you censured Datou
for spending his time gambling

296
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:56,400
You called him a bum
who spent his days idling

297
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:59,200
You're the pot calling
the kettle black

298
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:06,000
Your Majesty, I have brought you
this lingzhi from a snowy mountain

299
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:10,000
It's said to be more valuable
than the ordinary lingzhi

300
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:14,200
Grown in the deep mountains,
it's nourished by spring water

301
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:16,200
This lingzhi grows
once in every 100 years

302
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:22,000
Your Majesty, the lingzhi not only
relaxes one's muscles and bones and..

303
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:25,800
strengthens one's constitution,
it also prolongs one's life

304
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:27,200
I see

305
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:31,800
Your Majesty is kept busy with
the affairs of the state

306
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:35,600
Do take care of your health,
Your Majesty

307
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:41,200
It's rumoured that King Bochifan
is eyeing my throne

308
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:46,400
This issue is vexing me

309
00:22:46,600 --> 00:22:51,600
Your Majesty, leave this matter
to your subject

310
00:22:51,600 --> 00:22:53,400
What is your strategy?

311
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:55,800
To fortify our foreign relations,

312
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:59,800
I have had some personal dealings
with the king's subordinates

313
00:22:59,800 --> 00:23:01,800
We've even forged an alliance

314
00:23:02,600 --> 00:23:04,400
-Is that so?
-Yes

315
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,800
The moment Bochifan takes action,

316
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:11,800
they will turn against their king
and aid us in dealing with him

317
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:14,600
You're indeed a pillar of our court

318
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:20,000
It is my obligation
to serve Your Majesty

319
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:21,800
It's also to be expected of me

320
00:23:21,800 --> 00:23:28,400
Good! I hear you and Princess Ruining
are in love with each other

321
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:30,800
When will you be getting married?

322
00:23:30,800 --> 00:23:32,800
Your Majesty shall decide for us

323
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:35,200
Father

324
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,200
Father

325
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:39,600
-Ruining
-There you are

326
00:23:40,520 --> 00:23:43,400
-Greetings, Your Highness
-Xiaotian, you're here too

327
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:45,920
You may take your leave

328
00:23:47,400 --> 00:23:50,800
Where have you been? Do you still
remember you have a father?

329
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:54,800
-I wouldn't dare forget you, Father
-Any interesting encounters?

330
00:23:54,800 --> 00:23:59,600
There are so many! Ping'an Town is
one of them. I'll fill you in one day

331
00:23:59,600 --> 00:24:02,200
I'd like Father to meet someone today

332
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:05,400
-Who is that?
-He's a capable man

333
00:24:05,600 --> 00:24:08,680
Is that so?
You shall tell me about him

334
00:24:25,400 --> 00:24:29,200
His name is Wei Delu.
I got to know him in Ping'an Town

335
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:32,000
He's well-read and talented

336
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:34,800
A shame he's not holding
any official title

337
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:38,800
But he is a talent that
we'll ill-afford to miss

338
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:41,200
I believe he'll be of service
to the imperial court in due time

339
00:24:41,200 --> 00:24:46,200
The Capital has no lack of learned
men. Why pick him in particular?

340
00:24:46,400 --> 00:24:48,800
Father, he's not just one of them

341
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:54,400
Since he comes highly recommended,
I'd like to see how capable he is,

342
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:57,800
so much so that my daughter
sings his praises

343
00:24:57,800 --> 00:24:59,200
Thank you, Father

344
00:25:03,800 --> 00:25:06,400
Look who we've got here

345
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:11,200
Aren't you that Wei-something?

346
00:25:11,200 --> 00:25:13,400
It is Delu

347
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:19,400
That's right. How did you sneak into
the highly-guarded palace grounds?

348
00:25:19,520 --> 00:25:23,400
Why can't I be here?
Any idea who brought me in?

349
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:25,200
Her Highness did

350
00:25:27,800 --> 00:25:32,800
Are you aware that there are rules
governing the Palace?

351
00:25:32,800 --> 00:25:34,200
What rules?

352
00:25:34,600 --> 00:25:37,400
Commoners and dogs
are barred from entering

353
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:40,400
What's that supposed to mean?

354
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:43,800
Are you calling me a dog?

355
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:47,400
I won't hold you in awe
just because you're a marquis

356
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:51,200
You said it yourself.
I didn't say anything

357
00:25:58,200 --> 00:26:01,800
His Majesty has just betrothed
Her Highness to me

358
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:04,800
-Congratulate me
-I don't believe you!

359
00:26:04,800 --> 00:26:09,000
You don't? You can always ask
His Majesty about it. Go on

360
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:13,200
His Majesty would be fatuous
and blind to do that

361
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:28,400
What do you think you are?

362
00:26:28,600 --> 00:26:31,200
You're just a heap of dog poo!

363
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,200
Wait! Make yourself clear

364
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:41,800
-You hit me!
-I didn't even touch you

365
00:26:41,800 --> 00:26:44,200
You slipped and fell. Get up

366
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,400
Stop it!

367
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:48,520
How dare you make trouble
on palace grounds!

368
00:26:54,200 --> 00:27:01,200
Is he the well-learned talent
you were telling me about?

369
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:05,800
-Father, hear me out
-Not another word

370
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:10,800
The gall of you to call me
fatuous and blind!

371
00:27:10,800 --> 00:27:13,800
And you made trouble and hit someone
on palace grounds

372
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:18,200
It's on my daughter's account
that I shan't punish you

373
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:33,200
Know your limits

374
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:56,200
Wei Delu simply went overboard!

375
00:27:56,200 --> 00:28:01,400
To think the man I recommended
misbehaved in front of Father

376
00:28:01,400 --> 00:28:03,800
He's embarrassed me totally

377
00:28:05,600 --> 00:28:08,000
Don't be upset over it, Your Highness

378
00:28:08,000 --> 00:28:10,800
Let's think of a way
to salvage the situation

379
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:13,400
Do you want him to stay in the temple
all his life?

380
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:16,800
Young Master Wei only acted on
impulse. He's a talent after all

381
00:28:16,800 --> 00:28:21,000
That I know. Why else did I go out
of my way to help him?

382
00:28:21,000 --> 00:28:26,400
But he's offended Father. I doubt
he'll get to serve the imperial court

383
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:29,400
Poor Young Master Wei

384
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:45,200
-Hongying, do something for me
-Yes, Your Highness

385
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:48,400
Pass this gold-flecked fan
to Young Master Wei

386
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:51,480
It's to thank him for escorting me
to the Capital

387
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:54,800
I'll do it right away

388
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:25,800
-Why did you hit me?
-You're a nuisance

389
00:29:25,800 --> 00:29:29,400
I'm feeling vexed enough but you just
won't stop shuffling around me

390
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:33,400
You're the one who's unsettled.
I didn't move at all

391
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:35,400
I was sweeping the floor

392
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:40,200
I don't have the energy
to discuss Buddhism with you

393
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:44,400
Leave before I give you
another swipe on the head

394
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:46,800
Help! Help!

395
00:29:47,600 --> 00:29:49,200
Take that with you!

396
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:51,600
Young Master Wei

397
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:55,200
Hongying?

398
00:29:55,200 --> 00:29:58,600
-Young Master Wei
-Her Highness wants to see me?

399
00:29:58,600 --> 00:30:02,200
Her Highness wants me to deliver
a present to Young Master Wei

400
00:30:02,400 --> 00:30:04,400
A present for me?

401
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:20,920
A gold-flecked fan?

402
00:30:21,200 --> 00:30:24,600
Her Highness wants you to have it

403
00:30:24,600 --> 00:30:29,000
Did she say why she wanted me
to have this fan?

404
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:35,400
Her Highness said it is to thank you
for escorting her back to the Capital

405
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:38,000
The fan is a thank-you gift

406
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:42,200
-Anything else?
-Her Highness said nothing else

407
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:50,400
-I don't think so
-What is it?

408
00:30:57,800 --> 00:31:00,800
-I know!
-What is it?

409
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:04,800
That's right.
That should be it

410
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:08,000
What is it, Young Master Wei?

411
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:12,200
Do you know why Her Highness
gave me this fan?

412
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:17,000
Like she said, it's to thank you for
escorting her back to the Capital

413
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:22,200
Don't just take things at face value.
Learn from me

414
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:24,800
Meaning?

415
00:31:24,800 --> 00:31:30,400
I was just as puzzled when I first
received this gold-flecked fan

416
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:35,200
Gold-flecked fan...

417
00:31:36,200 --> 00:31:39,400
The fan embodies a great significance

418
00:31:39,400 --> 00:31:41,400
What's so significant about it?

419
00:31:42,600 --> 00:31:45,200
Do you know what gold foil signifies?

420
00:31:45,200 --> 00:31:48,200
It means the friendship between
Her Highness and me...

421
00:31:48,200 --> 00:31:51,800
is stronger and
more precious than gold

422
00:31:58,200 --> 00:32:00,000
What are you doing?

423
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:02,200
Young Master Wei, are you all right?

424
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:08,800
Of course. Now, do you know
what the fan represents?

425
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:12,800
The fan (shan) means separation (san)

426
00:32:12,800 --> 00:32:17,800
But since the fan is already
in my hands,

427
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:23,800
it means Her Highness' affections
for me will never go away

428
00:32:26,200 --> 00:32:31,200
Her Highness... Her Highness has
put so much thought into it

429
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:36,800
Princess Ruining is so thoughtful as
to express her feelings...

430
00:32:36,800 --> 00:32:38,400
through this fan

431
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:46,400
But of course. A girl should be
more restrained in her actions,

432
00:32:46,400 --> 00:32:51,000
let alone royalty like Her Highness

433
00:32:51,200 --> 00:32:55,200
Even if her love were rejected,

434
00:32:57,000 --> 00:33:00,000
she wouldn't be left red-faced

435
00:33:02,800 --> 00:33:06,400
What an ingenious idea

436
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:10,800
I think you're mistaken. That's not
what Her Highness meant at all

437
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:14,400
No? Then did Her Highness
say anything to you?

438
00:33:14,400 --> 00:33:17,000
Well... She said nothing

439
00:33:17,000 --> 00:33:22,600
Nothing? I'm glad to hear that.
Stop imagining things

440
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:24,400
I'm imagining things? I'd say...

441
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:30,000
If Her Highness doesn't fancy me,
why is she giving me this fan?

442
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:32,800
She didn't give one to
Ouyang Xiaotian, did she?

443
00:33:33,800 --> 00:33:35,800
Do you agree?

444
00:33:37,400 --> 00:33:38,600
Yes

445
00:33:49,600 --> 00:33:53,800
Did Her Highness say
when she'd visit me?

446
00:33:54,400 --> 00:33:55,800
No, she didn't

447
00:34:10,200 --> 00:34:12,400
She didn't mention it

448
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:15,800
You'd like to see Her Highness?

449
00:34:16,800 --> 00:34:18,400
Happy waiting

450
00:34:23,200 --> 00:34:27,400
Why am I so impatient?
We still have days ahead of us

451
00:34:28,200 --> 00:34:35,200
For a love that abides forever,
the lovers need not meet every day

452
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:40,520
You're too much

453
00:34:58,000 --> 00:35:02,400
Shou, if we just walk in
the direction of the Big Dipper,

454
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:04,400
we'll reach Heavenly Abode

455
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:09,200
-How did you know that?
-Just know that I know

456
00:35:09,200 --> 00:35:13,200
Shou, you've been walking all day.
Let's get some rest here

457
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:17,000
-Why didn't you say so earlier?
-Pardon me?

458
00:35:17,200 --> 00:35:19,800
Nothing. I was asking
if you feel thirsty

459
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:24,600
You eat first

460
00:35:24,600 --> 00:35:26,600
I shan't stand on ceremony then

461
00:35:27,200 --> 00:35:28,800
It's sesame seed cake

462
00:35:31,200 --> 00:35:32,400
It's delicious

463
00:35:36,920 --> 00:35:40,400
-What are you laughing at?
-You eat just like a child

464
00:35:50,520 --> 00:35:56,600
Ruyi, if only you were always
this gentle and understanding

465
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:05,800
A shooting star!
Make a wish, quick!

466
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:10,000
-You actually believe in that?
-It's true for those who believe

467
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:11,600
Close your eyes and
make a wish, quick!

468
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:21,800
Why are you looking at me?
You've made your wish?

469
00:36:21,800 --> 00:36:24,800
-What did you wish for?
-I made a simple wish

470
00:36:24,800 --> 00:36:29,000
I wished that you'd regain
your lovely looks soon

471
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:34,000
Thanks, Shou.
You're so good to me

472
00:36:34,200 --> 00:36:37,000
Now, what wish did you make?

473
00:36:37,200 --> 00:36:40,200
Me? It's a secret!

474
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:43,800
A secret? I know what it is

475
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:48,400
-Don't try to act smart
-I'm not

476
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:53,200
The fact that you won't say it means
it has something to do with me

477
00:36:53,200 --> 00:36:55,400
-Wrong
-I don't think so

478
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:59,400
-Stop making wild guesses
-I bet it involves me

479
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:01,400
Stop making wild guesses

480
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:09,400
It says here that we've reached
the Heavenly Abode

481
00:37:11,800 --> 00:37:13,200
It should be over there

482
00:37:25,200 --> 00:37:27,600
Ruyi, we've finally reached
Heavenly Abode

483
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:31,800
Deity of Medicine!

484
00:37:31,800 --> 00:37:34,800
Are you there?
We're here to seek your help

485
00:37:34,800 --> 00:37:35,800
Deity of Medicine!

486
00:37:37,200 --> 00:37:41,200
-Who are you?
-Deity of Medicine, I'm Mei Shouquan

487
00:37:41,200 --> 00:37:43,400
I've brought Ma Ruyi
to seek medical help

488
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:46,000
The man enters while
the lady stays outside

489
00:37:46,200 --> 00:37:50,800
-Why can't I enter?
-I don't owe you an explanation

490
00:37:52,600 --> 00:37:55,920
Shou, he's an eccentric chap.
You'd better not go inside

491
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:58,400
-Let's get out of here
-But we've come all the way here

492
00:37:58,400 --> 00:38:01,800
Recluses tend to be eccentric.
Don't worry about me

493
00:38:01,800 --> 00:38:05,200
Wait here for me.
I won't be long. Don't worry

494
00:38:05,200 --> 00:38:07,800
I'll be out soon.
Wait for me

495
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:13,000
-Shou, be careful
-Wait for me. I'll be fine

496
00:38:19,000 --> 00:38:21,200
Deity of Medicine

497
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,200
Deity of Medicine

498
00:38:31,400 --> 00:38:35,200
Deity of Medicine

499
00:38:42,800 --> 00:38:47,000
-Are you Deity of Medicine?
-Just state your purpose of visit

500
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:52,800
Deity of Medicine,

501
00:38:53,800 --> 00:38:58,800
my good friend's face was
suddenly covered in freckles

502
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:01,200
I hope you'll treat her face

503
00:39:02,200 --> 00:39:06,400
That's a piece of cake.
But...

504
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:09,400
But what? Just tell me

505
00:39:09,480 --> 00:39:12,400
But you've got to turn around first

506
00:39:14,400 --> 00:39:17,400
-Who are you?
-Who am I?

507
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:22,200
This handsome man here
has been sitting here all this time

508
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:25,800
Can't you tell I'm Deity of Medicine?

509
00:39:25,800 --> 00:39:28,800
You're Deity of Medicine?
Then he is...

510
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:33,400
I'm sorry. It's a misunderstanding

511
00:39:33,400 --> 00:39:37,200
You actually mistook him for me

512
00:39:37,200 --> 00:39:43,800
Since you're here,
you should abide by my rules

513
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:48,600
If you want to seek treatment,
you'll pay a life for a life

514
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:54,800
I know. I'm willing to exchange
my life for Ruyi's face

515
00:39:56,520 --> 00:40:00,800
You'll give up your life
for that woman?

516
00:40:01,400 --> 00:40:04,400
-Yes
-No regrets?

517
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:07,800
Yes, no regrets

518
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:12,400
I've always been sickly.
My days on earth are numbered

519
00:40:12,600 --> 00:40:16,800
If I could use my life in exchange
for Ruyi's face,

520
00:40:17,000 --> 00:40:18,800
I'll die with no regrets

521
00:40:20,200 --> 00:40:27,200
I'll be honest with you. I've spent
my life experimenting prescriptions

522
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:32,200
But no one has been willing
to be my guinea pig

523
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:38,200
Don't worry. I won't kill you

524
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:40,800
I just want to experiment on you

525
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:43,400
You'll just swap your head
with my old master's

526
00:40:43,400 --> 00:40:46,200
Let's see if he'll survive

527
00:40:47,200 --> 00:40:51,600
-Who's your old master?
-That's him

528
00:40:52,400 --> 00:40:56,400
-He's your old master?!
-That's right

529
00:40:56,400 --> 00:40:59,800
-I'm to swap heads with him?!
-That's right

530
00:41:01,000 --> 00:41:06,200
Are you regretting it now?
It's still not too late to back out

531
00:41:06,200 --> 00:41:09,400
I will never, ever regret it

532
00:41:11,200 --> 00:41:19,400
Good! I didn't expect such
a sentimental and loyal man to exist

533
00:41:20,200 --> 00:41:24,200
You'd give up everything
for the sake of your friend

534
00:41:24,400 --> 00:41:28,800
Good! Your wish shall be granted

535
00:41:49,400 --> 00:41:51,800
My face has recovered!

536
00:41:52,600 --> 00:41:54,200
My face has recovered!

537
00:41:56,200 --> 00:41:58,000
Shou!

538
00:42:02,600 --> 00:42:03,600
Ruyi

539
00:42:04,200 --> 00:42:07,400
Shou, what happened to you?

540
00:42:07,600 --> 00:42:12,600
Don't be afraid. I'm fine,
but my body feels itchy

541
00:42:12,600 --> 00:42:14,800
It feels like I've got lice on me

542
00:42:19,800 --> 00:42:20,800
Shou!

543
00:42:21,200 --> 00:42:24,000
Darn it! It must be
Deity of Medicine's doing

544
00:42:24,200 --> 00:42:28,200
Deity of Medicine!

545
00:42:30,200 --> 00:42:34,000
-Deity of Medicine!
-I heard you all right

546
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:38,400
It's been a while but you're still
as hot-tempered as ever

547
00:42:38,400 --> 00:42:43,000
Cut your crap! Just what did you do
to Mei Shouquan?!

548
00:42:43,200 --> 00:42:48,800
Easy, easy.
He came to me of his own accord

549
00:42:48,800 --> 00:42:54,800
He was willing to pay any price
to get your face treated

550
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:59,800
So I decided to swap his body
with Old Master's

551
00:42:59,800 --> 00:43:03,800
So I carried out my little experiment

552
00:43:04,200 --> 00:43:08,800
How could you do that? I could live
with the spots on my face

553
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:11,200
Why sacrifice Mei Shouquan?

554
00:43:13,000 --> 00:43:16,600
Do I consider that a plea from you?

555
00:43:17,200 --> 00:43:21,400
Remember how you used to despise me?

556
00:43:22,200 --> 00:43:26,400
Deity of Medicine, I'm sorry
about the past. I apologize

557
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:30,400
Forgive me. Mei Shouquan has been
relegated to a mortal

558
00:43:30,400 --> 00:43:34,000
He has to earn enough merit
to be reinstated

559
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:37,520
Why should I care?

560
00:43:40,400 --> 00:43:45,400
Deity of Medicine, I'm begging you.
I'll do anything you ask of me

561
00:43:47,680 --> 00:43:56,600
Ma-gu, oh, Ma-gu, to think
you'd actually eat humble pie

562
00:43:57,600 --> 00:44:00,800
I'll pay any price to have
the three stars reinstated

563
00:44:02,400 --> 00:44:07,400
I get it now. You'll give up
your lives for each other

564
00:44:07,400 --> 00:44:14,600
Let me warn you. By falling in love,
you're breaking the celestial law

565
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:16,800
That's my own business

566
00:44:17,200 --> 00:44:20,800
I just ask that you save Mei Shouquan

567
00:44:20,800 --> 00:44:23,200
Save him? That's a piece of cake

568
00:44:24,200 --> 00:44:28,200
But you've got
to promise me something

569
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:29,800
What is it?

570
00:44:30,400 --> 00:44:36,200
I'm working on this Obedience Spell

571
00:44:36,400 --> 00:44:40,400
Are you willing to be my guinea pig?

572
00:44:41,200 --> 00:44:42,400
No problem!

573
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:44,880
No regrets?

574
00:44:51,000 --> 00:44:52,200
Done!

575
00:44:53,200 --> 00:44:54,200
Subtitled by A Han


